   "notes": "Walk-in gable-roofed timber cabin (remade sheet; door 3.60 x 7.00 clear over a 0.08 sill on a 2.60 floor, rises 0.87 / 0.86 / 0.87): one course of big pale stone blocks with lighter corner blocks, plank floor, five rows of planks between chamfered corner posts, a barred window with a dark inner shutter in each long wall, the door between tall posts on golden caps under a lintel and collar (leaf open inward 95 deg), octagonal-ended eave beams with iron brackets, rafters, purlins and a ridge beam under two closed cream canvas slabs with a seam grid and golden U ties, crossed bargeboards with golden saddles and cleats, a stone chimney with a crenellated cap (thin pale chimney_smoke), two-tread stairs, three Neon lanterns (heat_glow), a red banner on an X-lashed pole, two barrels and a crate. Collision precise: Requires Manual Validation in Studio (walk in, turn round, walk out)."
